{
  "description": "Real trades on the Vorda launchpad bonding curve (GIWA Sepolia testnet). Every amount is a base-10 string of the smallest unit (wei, or 1e-18 token).",
  "chainId": 91342,
  "launchpad": "0xb36ee0ACEAe9685c3fCe5e6cB9e05D385f7bd5fB",
  "rpc": "https://sepolia-rpc.giwa.io",
  "explorer": "https://sepolia-explorer.giwa.io",
  "howCollected": [
    "state: getCurve(token) and platformFeeBps() read with eth_call at stateBlock (= block - 1); feeBps = platformFeeBps + creatorFeeBps.",
    "For method \"createToken\" the token does not exist at stateBlock; state is the initial curve from the TokenCreated event of the same transaction, and ethIn = msg.value - creationFee (creationFee was 0).",
    "Only transactions that call the launchpad directly, and are the only trade of that token in their block, are included.",
    "buy: ethIn = msg.value; expected.tokensOut = Trade.tokenAmount; expected.fee = Trade.fee; expected.refund = ethIn - Trade.ethAmount - Trade.fee.",
    "sell: tokensIn = Trade.tokenAmount; expected.fee = Trade.fee; expected.ethOut = Trade.ethAmount - Trade.fee."
  ],
